  "description": "When word of Princess Psyche’s beauty outshines the temples of Aphrodite, the goddess sends Eros to deliver a devastating curse to the princess. However, the mission fails when Eros catches a glimpse of the princess’s hidden truth. Stunned by the realization that this perfect maiden is harboring a deeply masculine secret, Eros slips and pricks himself with his own golden arrow. Now bound by an inescapable passion, Eros spends his nights visiting Psyche’s dark bedchamber, eager to see the deceptive beauty who is far more than a simple princess.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
